msgctxt "3076\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Smash an opponent against a wall. The most basic of basic\n"
"Heat Actions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3148\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Crush an opponent from behind. Takes a bit of finesse to\n"
"pull off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3215\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Smash an opponent's head against an object."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3259\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Smash an opponent's head against an object from behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3315\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Use a nearby pole to crush an unsuspecting opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3368\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Quickly eliminate an opponent by throwing them off of a\n"
"high place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3436\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A fierce attack that destroys an opponent's tailbone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3490\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Drop an opponent on a protruding object. It's a real\n"
"brain buster."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3557\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Essence of Throwing, but restricted to the area around\n"
"the Kubochi river. Might still be too cold for a swim,\n"
"but that's their problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3693\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Send an opponent tumbling down a flight of stairs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3744\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Smash an opponent against a fence and grate their head\n"
"with it. Take a little off the top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3835\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Fling your opponent into a chain-link fence, and then\n"
"fling yourself into your opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3924\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Beat an enemy with a one-handed weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3964\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Use an umbrella's hooked handle to reel an enemy in and\n"
"then cast them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4040\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Get a strike on your opponent's shins and bowl them into\n"
"the gutter. Spare no mercy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4125\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Force a mystery liquid down an enemy's throat. Does more\n"
"psychological damage than physical... Probably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4230\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Inject a mysterious syringe into an opponent's posterior.\n"
"Hopefully it isn't too dangerous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4322\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rub salt into an enemy's eyes. Show your enemies what it\n"
"means to be salty. Even works on those wearing glasses!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4435\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Grill an enemy's face with a gas burner. As simple as\n"
"throwing a pie, and more painful than you can imagine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4544\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Forcefully extract an opponent's tooth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4584\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Give your opponents a free manicure, Dragon of Dojima\n"
"style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4645\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Strangle an opponent with a rope. They might have trouble\n"
"breathing for a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4726\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Stab your opponent through the gut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4762\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Pin your opponent's hand to the wall with a dagger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4814\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Pin your opponent's hand to a platform with a dagger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4868\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Charge your stun gun with electrified passion, powering\n"
"it up beyond its physical limits. Transcends modern\n"
"understanding of physics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5002\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Send enemies out of the park with a powerful swing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5054\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Send an opponent flying down range. Not a fair way to\n"
"play, but a nice shot nonetheless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5143\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Lift enemies up from between their legs and slam them\n"
"onto the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5214\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Force something on an opponent's head and spin it. Then\n"
"break them with a knifehand strike as though they were\n"
"a pile of bricks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5343\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A basic attack passed down through the Lotus School.\n"
"Trip the opponent, and then deal additional attacks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5449\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Use the weight of the hammer to pound enemies into the\n"
"ground with a series of powerful blows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5544\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Trap your opponent and send them flying. Makes use of\n"
"powerful centrifugal force. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5627\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Drop something heavy on an enemy's head. Sometimes simple\n"
"is best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5694\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Rattle an enemy's brains with a blow to the head, then\n"
"finish him with a final blow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5779\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A graceful, majestic strike that uses nunchaku to their\n"
"utmost potential."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5853\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "An attack utilizing basic tonfa techniques."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5897\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Use your kali sticks to rain blow after blow upon your\n"
"opponent, rendering them helpless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5987\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A simple stomp to the enemy's face. Strengthening your\n"
"abilities increases the scope of this attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6088\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A simple and popular attack. Throw an object onto a\n"
"downed enemy, putting the force of your body and soul\n"
"behind it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6205\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A devastating attack. Just when the enemy thinks you're\n"
"finished, come down upon them with all your might."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6312\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"No need to damage your weapons this time. Just stomp on\n"
"your opponent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6383\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Keep your weapons pristine and send your enemy flying\n"
"with a well-placed kick. Make them wish you had used a\n"
"weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6500\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Put all your weight into a blow to the enemy's face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6553\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Bring the hammer down on your foe. Literally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6599\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Turn the tables by tackling the opponent and punching\n"
"them while they're down. A vicious attack for a cornered\n"
"attacker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6720\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Seize victory from a powerful opponent by smashing your\n"
"knee into their head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6798\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Overwhelm a powerful enemy and use them as a weapon to\n"
"deal massive damage to nearby foes. Not great against\n"
"single foes but still flashy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6937\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Unleash a series of judo joint locks upon a powerful\n"
"opponent. Victims will feel as though hell itself has\n"
"opened up to swallow them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7071\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Take out two birds with one stone by dropping one enemy\n"
"onto another who's lying on the ground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7167\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Take out two birds with one stone by dropping one enemy\n"
"onto another who's lying on the ground. Deals a bit more\n"
"damage from behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7300\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Swing a foe around and use them as a weapon. Those\n"
"involved catch a glimpse into hell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7387\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Show your devilish side by picking up an enemy and\n"
"swinging them into a wall. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7466\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Pick up a foe and swing them into a pole. Maybe catching\n"
"a glimpse of heaven will help them realize the error of\n"
"their ways."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7591\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Grab your opponent by the feet and ruthlessly plow them\n"
"into a surface. Named after former Coliseum fighter\n"
"Cyclops Oba."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7712\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Mercilessly swing an enemy into a car windshield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7762\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "Visciously bash two enemies' heads together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7807\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Grab an opponent and smash them into the ground. Put all\n"
"your strength, spirit, and weight into one devastating\n"
"blow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7925\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Grab an opponent from behind and smash them into the\n"
"ground. Put all your strength, spirit, and weight into\n"
"one devastating blow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8055\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A basic sword attack learned from Master Komaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8104\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A solid attack strong enough to crack the shell of a\n"
"divine tortoise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8174\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A graceful attack swift enough to strike a divine phoenix\n"
"from the air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8246\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A magnificent attack powerful enough to take down a divine\n"
"dragon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8313\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "A brutal attack fierce enough to vanquish a divine tiger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8371\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Defend yourself against an enemy with a handgun by\n"
"bringing them down before they can fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8463\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Punish an opponent for bringing a shotgun to a fist fight.\n"
"Redirect their shot, disarm them, then take them down with\n"
"a kick to the face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8601\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Komaki has revived an ancient unarmed attack and\n"
"repurposed it for the modern era as a non-lethal takedown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8709\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An ancient attack that splits open an enemy's head using\n"
"their own body weight. Learn from the past to protect the\n"
"future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8832\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A visionary move created in Sozaemon Komaki's later years.\n"
"He was said to have been the most powerful disciple of\n"
"the Komaki style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8964\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of Miyamoto Musashi's secret techniques. Reminiscent\n"
"of a bird capturing its prey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9051\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of Miyamoto Musashi's secret techniques. Reminiscent\n"
"of a charging bull."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9128\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of Miyamoto Musashi's secret techniques. Reminiscent\n"
"of a cat's nimble two-step leap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9218\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of Miyamoto Musashi's secret techniques. Epitomizes\n"
"the ferocity of his unique double-bladed style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9322\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of Miyamoto Musashi's secret techniques. Swat down\n"
"your foes as though they were but flies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9418\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"One of Miyamoto Musashi's secret techniques.\n"
"Reminiscent of a wolf's swift and accurate strike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9514\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A secret move that catches enemies off guard. Holding\n"
"your weapon is enough to strike fear into your foes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9621\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"A secret street fighting technique. Skillfully use a lit\n"
"cigarette to create an opening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9710\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"After an ally smashes the back of your opponent's head\n"
"into the ground with a powerbomb, cave in their face with\n"
"a stomp."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9832\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Drive your knee into an opponent's face while they're\n"
"being restrained by an ally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9915\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Jump over rails and short objects to land a crushing\n"
"blow. Inspired by a lady obsessed with a movie star."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10021\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Wrap around an enemy and bring them to the ground\n"
"acrobatically. Inspired by a pole-dancing drunk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10120\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Launch out of a forward roll and into your opponent.\n"
"Inspired by a pathetic guy at the batting center."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10223\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Disarm a foe, then use their weapon to beat them into\n"
"submission. Inspired by a guy delivering noodles."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10327\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Teach an enemy to keep their hands to themselves.\n"
"Inspired by a girl being grabbed by a drunk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10422\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Surprise an opponent while you're knocked down.\n"
"Inspired by an upset boy outside a toy store."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10516\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Drunkenly avoid an attack, then retaliate with a\n"
"shoulder thrust. Inspired by a drunk in Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10617\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Strike down your opponents with frightful speed.\n"
"Inspired by a woman passing out tissues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10707\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"An attack with immense power that belies its simplicity.\n"
"Legend has it that one punch can reform a man."
msgstr ""